            <div class="dm-finance-provider__brand-label"><span>Product category</span><strong>Credit financing</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="dm-finance-provider__content">
            <p>Synchrony offers credit cards and loans. Ask Discount Mattress which current Synchrony application and promotional financing offers are available for your purchase.</p>
            <dl class="dm-finance-provider__facts">
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Application</dt><dd>Credit approval is required. Synchrony states that credit card and loan applications may affect your credit score.</dd></div>
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>After approval</dt><dd>Use the approved credit product to complete the purchase, then make payments under the account agreement.</dd></div>
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Promotions</dt><dd>Available offers may use deferred-interest or reduced-interest terms. Offers vary.</dd></div>
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Review</dt><dd>Check the APR, minimum payment, promotion expiration, and what happens if the promotional balance is not paid on time.</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p class="dm-finance-provider__steps-title">Typical process</p>
            <ol class="dm-finance-provider__steps"><li>Confirm the purchase total.</li><li>Request the current application.</li><li>Submit the application to Synchrony.</li><li>Review the credit agreement before purchase.</li></ol>
            <div class="dm-finance-provider__links"><a class="dm-page__button" href="tel:12704951603" aria-label="Request a financing application by calling Discount Mattress at (270) 495-1603">Request a financing application</a><a class="dm-finance-provider__official" href="https://www.synchrony.com/financing/how-it-works" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Synchrony’s financing guide</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="dm-finance-provider dm-finance-provider--kafene">
          <div class="dm-finance-provider__brand">
            <img src="{{ 'kafene-logo.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Kafene" width="174" height="56" loading="lazy">
