          </div>
          <div class="dm-finance-provider__content">
            <p>Kafene is not a loan. If an application is approved, Kafene purchases the merchandise from the store and leases it to the customer until the customer obtains ownership.</p>
            <dl class="dm-finance-provider__facts">
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Application</dt><dd>Kafene says its application typically takes about 60 seconds. Approval is not guaranteed.</dd></div>
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Basic eligibility</dt><dd>Kafene lists age 18+, government-issued ID, at least $800 monthly income, and an active checking account.</dd></div>
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Payments</dt><dd>Accounts are generally set for automatic payments aligned with the customer’s pay schedule. The agreement provides the exact frequency and amount.</dd></div>
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Ownership and return</dt><dd>Ownership follows completion of required payments or an available early purchase option. Kafene also describes a right to end the lease and arrange return under its terms.</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p class="dm-finance-provider__steps-title">Typical process</p>
            <ol class="dm-finance-provider__steps"><li>Apply through the store’s Kafene link.</li><li>Kafene provides its decision and approved amount.</li><li>Review and sign the lease on your phone.</li><li>Make the agreed payments until purchase or return.</li></ol>
            <div class="dm-finance-provider__links"><a class="dm-page__button" href="tel:12704951603" aria-label="Request a financing application by calling Discount Mattress at (270) 495-1603">Request a financing application</a><a class="dm-finance-provider__official" href="https://www.kafene.com/faq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Kafene’s customer FAQ</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="dm-finance-provider dm-finance-provider--snap">
          <div class="dm-finance-provider__brand">
            <img src="{{ 'snapfin-logo.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Snap Finance" width="108" height="48" loading="lazy">
            <div class="dm-finance-provider__brand-label"><span>Product category</span><strong>Offer type varies</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="dm-finance-provider__content">
            <p>Snap Finance supports lease-to-own, bank-partner installment loans, and merchant retail installment contracts. The product offered depends on the merchant, purchase, and state.</p>
            <dl class="dm-finance-provider__facts">
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Application</dt><dd>Snap accepts applications online or through participating stores. Not all applicants are approved.</dd></div>
