              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Approved amount</dt><dd>Snap states that average approvals across its product types range from $300 to $5,000, subject to underwriting.</dd></div>
              <div class="dm-finance-provider__fact"><dt>Ownership and payments</dt><dd>For lease-to-own, Snap owns the merchandise until required payments or an early purchase are completed. Loan and installment-contract terms work differently.</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <p class="dm-finance-provider__steps-title">Typical process</p>
            <ol class="dm-finance-provider__steps"><li>Apply using the store’s Snap option.</li><li>Snap provides a decision and available product.</li><li>Identify the product type and total cost.</li><li>Sign the agreement and follow its payment schedule.</li></ol>
            <div class="dm-finance-provider__links"><a class="dm-page__button" href="tel:12704951603" aria-label="Request a financing application by calling Discount Mattress at (270) 495-1603">Request a financing application</a><a class="dm-finance-provider__official" href="https://snapfinance.com/how-it-works" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read Snap Finance’s guide</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>
