      <section class="dm-financing__start">
        <div class="dm-financing__start-inner">
          <div><p class="dm-page__eyebrow">Start at Discount Mattress</p><h2>Get the correct application for your purchase</h2><p>Provider programs and promotional offers can change. Call or visit so the team can confirm the current application and eligible purchase amount.</p><div class="dm-financing__hero-actions"><a class="dm-page__button" href="tel:12704951603">Call (270) 495-1603</a><a class="dm-page__button dm-page__button--outline" href="/pages/locations">View showrooms</a></div></div>
          <div class="dm-financing__checklist">
            <div class="dm-financing__check"><span>1</span><div><strong>Choose the merchandise</strong><p>Confirm the mattress, size, accessories, taxes, and complete purchase amount.</p></div></div>
            <div class="dm-financing__check"><span>2</span><div><strong>Get the current provider link</strong><p>Discount Mattress will identify the applications currently available for that purchase.</p></div></div>
            <div class="dm-financing__check"><span>3</span><div><strong>Review the written agreement</strong><p>Confirm the product type, payment schedule, total cost, interest or cost of lease, and ownership terms before accepting.</p></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <p class="dm-financing__disclosure">Financing and lease-to-own are subject to provider approval, eligibility, state availability, and the provider’s written terms. Discount Mattress does not guarantee approval or an advertised amount. Promotional financing may require minimum monthly payments and may include deferred interest. Lease-to-own generally costs more than the cash price if carried to the full term. Some Snap retail installment contracts may be originated by the merchant and serviced by Snap Finance. The agreement presented to you controls if it differs from this summary.</p>
